title start
kind: note
tags: business-plan brand brand-iconography-and-symbols
Brand iconography and symbols
title end

paragraph start
Icons use one line weight, one corner style and white on dark by default. A symbol is added only when it replaces words or marks a repeating content type.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Every icon is drawn on the same grid and tested at small size. Reuse beats variety, so a new icon needs a reason written beside it.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
icon name, meaning, where used, size tested
code end

